            "            max-h-[84px]\n",
            "            no-underline text-color-text text-sm font-normal px-2\n",
            "            my-1\" style=\"overflow: hidden;\">Hey! Do you want to speak for MarketingProfs?\n",
            "Do you also like money?\n",
            "But you really don't want to have to put on hard pants? \n",
            "\n",
            "Excellent. We should talk.\n",
            "\n",
            "We’re looking for speakers for an upcoming online MarketingProfs program — especially folks with practical AI use cases for:\n",
            "\n",
            "— social media\n",
            "— paid ad programs\n",
            "— ABM\n",
            "\n",
            "My colleague <a class=\"link activity-attributed-text z-[9999] relative\" href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/in/joellenroberts?trk=public_profile__posts-text\" target=\"_self\" data-tracking-control-name=\"public_profile__posts-text\" data-tracking-will-navigate=\"\">Jo Roberts</a> says she’s gotten lots of AI submissions already. (I’m not sure if you’ve heard of “AI,” but apparently it’s becoming a thing.)\n",
            "\n",
            "“But!” Jo says, in a very serious tone, “not enough in those three areas.” Our members are asking for them.\n",
            "\n",
            "So Jo is looking for gems and use cases on \"How to Do the Thing\" not just \"Talk About Maybe How to Do the Thing.\"  \n",
            "\n",
            "Maybe you have a gem-cut use case? Or you know someone who does? Tags/shares most welcome.\n",
            "\n",
            "Jo is standing by, ready to pounce. Submit here:\n",
            "\n",
            "<a class=\"link activity-attributed-text z-[9999] relative\" href=\"https://lnkd.in/eBHdDxhm?trk=public_profile__posts-text\" target=\"_self\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-tracking-control-name=\"public_profile__posts-text\" data-tracking-will-navigate=\"\">https://lnkd.in/eBHdDxhm</a>\n",
            "\n",
            "Deadline: EOD Wednesday, April 8\n",
            "\n",
            "Come teach smart, curious marketers useful things.\n",
            "Also get paid.\n",
            "Also be admired. (Probably by me.)\n",
            "Most of all: stay comfy.\n",
