            "            max-h-[64px]\n",
            "            no-underline text-color-text text-sm font-normal px-2\n",
            "            mb-1.5\" style=\"overflow: hidden;\">For the record, I have terrible handwriting.\n",
            "\n",
            "I always have.\n",
            "\n",
            "The nuns at St. Stan’s would grade it a C, the lowest mark on my report card. \n",
