            "\n",
            "Sometimes I even have a hard time deciphering what I wrote. \n",
            "\n",
            "And yet, I do write by hand.\n",
            "\n",
            "I take notes at conferences. \n",
            "\n",
            "Make notes before interviews. \n",
            "\n",
            "Scribble ideas for emails, mail packages, and ads I’m working on for clients. \n",
            "\n",
            "Brain scientists find it is better for memory.\n",
