            "              Ann Handley liked this\n",
            "          </span>\n",
            "        </a>\n",
            "\n",
            "      \n",
            "        <div data-see-more-text=\"more\" data-see-more-link=\"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/oliviabaud_literally-i-always-stop-to-smell-the-roses-activity-7449861575601094657-jb76\" class=\"see-more-text overflow-hidden whitespace-break-spaces\n",
            "            max-h-[64px]\n",
            "            no-underline text-color-text text-sm font-normal px-2\n",
            "            mb-1.5\" style=\"overflow: hidden;\">Literally, I always stop to smell the roses. (My musical comedian husband even made a catchy tune about it. It’s called “Sniff That Plant”. No, I’m not joking.)\n",
            "\n",
            "Figuratively… I really struggle to.\n",
            "\n",
            "I’ve always had a complicated relationship with ambition.\n",
            "\n",
            "On the one hand, being driven has helped me tremendously in life.\n",
            "\n",
            "On the other, being so laser-focused on reaching the next best thing has often robbed me of the present.\n",
            "\n",
            "When I founded <a class=\"link activity-attributed-text z-[9999] relative\" href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/company/clearwing-marketing?trk=public_profile__reactions-text\" target=\"_self\" data-tracking-control-name=\"public_profile__reactions-text\" data-tracking-will-navigate=\"\">Clearwing Marketing</a>, I promised myself that I would use it as an opportunity to build healthier, more sustainable habits.\n",
            "\n",
            "So, in that spirit, and in the hopes that it encourages you to do the same, here are the wins I'm celebrating, big and little, from my first three months of business:\n",
            "💫 Published and shared <a class=\"link activity-attributed-text z-[9999] relative\" href=\"http://ClearwingMarketing.com?trk=public_profile__reactions-text\" target=\"_self\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-tracking-control-name=\"public_profile__reactions-text\" data-tracking-will-navigate=\"\">ClearwingMarketing.com</a> with the world! I feel incredibly proud to have built this website from scratch.\n",
            "💫 Got paid for the first time under Clearwing Marketing!!\n",
            "💫 Secured the best first client I could ever ask for, <a class=\"link activity-attributed-text z-[9999] relative\" href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/in/beth-carter-a01b652?trk=public_profile__reactions-text\" target=\"_self\" data-tracking-control-name=\"public_profile__reactions-text\" data-tracking-will-navigate=\"\">Beth Carter</a>.\n",
            "💫 Set up an account with Wave Financial to generate invoices, track finances, collect payments, etc.\n",
            "💫 Sorted through the ever-confusing tax requirements for a small biz\n",
            "💫 Started regularly posting and engaging on LinkedIn, reaching 7,530 people.\n",
            "💫 Came up with my weekly lift-up doodle series, which helped me get back into a regular creative practice.\n",
            "💫 THE <a class=\"link activity-attributed-text z-[9999] relative\" href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/in/annhandley?trk=public_profile__reactions-text\" target=\"_self\" data-tracking-control-name=\"public_profile__reactions-text\" data-tracking-will-navigate=\"\">Ann Handley</a> (a superstar in the marketing world) sent me a friend request. I squealed like a 13-year-old.\n",
            "💫 Designed kick-a** business cards.\n",
            "💫 Researched and tested cold outreach tactics, pushing through the discomfort.\n",
            "💫 Created my first proposal deck for a reputable NGO in a two-day turnaround. Won the bid!\n",
            "&nbsp;\n",
            "P.S. If this makes you feel better about yourself, great! If this makes you compare, remember: Everyone's pace is different.\n",
            "\n",
            "P.P.S. If you’re still thinking about “Sniff That Plant,” I’ve added the link to the YouTube video in the comments. You’re welcome 😜\n",
            "\n",
            "📸 A picture of the daffodils I've been sticking my nose in lately. Do they give me a congestion headache? Yes. Will I keep smelling them anyways? Also yes.</div>\n",
